      <p class="pergola-model-type">Motorised louvres</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Roof operation</dt><dd>Powered adjustment by remote, Bluetooth app or compatible smart-home controls.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Lighting</dt><dd>Dimmable lighting built into the beams.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Check first</dt><dd>Electrical connection, controls, motor access and the dimensions for the chosen size.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
    <section class="pergola-model">
      <h3>Pergola 4 Pro Max</h3>
      <p class="pergola-model-type">Motorised, wider louvres</p>
